@startwbs
' Source (synthetic brief): the bookshop's data ownership. The data team owns the sales pipeline
' (extract and transform) and the reporting database; the web team owns the web shop and the orders
' database. Deploys to production are decided by the owning team lead, with the shop manager consulted
' for reporting changes; everyone is told in the weekly note.
' house-preamble-begin
' Knob LEGEND_FRAME: colour of the thin frame around the legend ("transparent" removes it).
!$LEGEND_FRAME = "#999999"
!theme plain
<style>
root { FontName "Helvetica"; FontSize 12 }
title { FontSize 16 }
legend { BackgroundColor transparent; LineColor $LEGEND_FRAME }
wbsDiagram {
  .data { BackgroundColor #E3F2FD }
  .process { BackgroundColor #E8F5E9 }
  .tooling { BackgroundColor #FFF3E0 }
  .people { BackgroundColor #F3E5F5 }
  .failure { BackgroundColor #FADBD8 }
  .gate { BackgroundColor #FFFFFF; LineThickness 2 }
}
</style>
' house-preamble-end

title Ownership tree for the bookshop's systems (synthetic)

* Bookshop
** Data team
*** Sales pipeline
**** Extract (till CSV, web orders)
**** Transform
*** Reporting DB
** Web team
*** Web shop
*** Orders DB

legend bottom
  |= Decision |= Decides |= Consulted |= Told |
  | deploy the sales pipeline | data team lead | shop manager | weekly note |
  | deploy the web shop | web team lead | none stated | weekly note |
endlegend
@endwbs
